":"","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Rejoignez LA GOMORRHÉE à POINT ÉPHÉMÈRE jeudi 27 août, pour regarder le dernier épisode de Drag Race France saison 4, avec vos drags préférées Fleur Dumähl, La Cagagne et Cassiopée, avec des performances décapantes, un girlsgroup, et un DJ Set de 23h à 01h !","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- A Point Éphémère","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- De 19h à 01h","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Viewing, review, drag show et DJ Set","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- à 5€ !","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"}],"video_id":null,"displayed_category":"Viewing party + Drag show + DJ set","category":"Rencontres","categorie_sec":null,"categorie_ter":null,"prix":"5€","facebook_link":{"link_type":"Any"},"ticket_link":{"link_type":"Web","key":"b02b3c17-81e2-409e-9268-a6df29288363","url":"https://link.dice.fm/sa42c10a0d3d?dice_id=sa42c10a0d3d","target":"_blank"},"title_effect":null,"slices":[],"meta_description":null,"meta_image":{},"meta_title":null}},{"id":"amdR8xEAACsAKIff","uid":"baby-b2808","url":null,"type":"event","href":"https://pointf.cdn.prismic.io/api/v2/documents/search?ref=ao8RoxIAAC4A-spV&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22amdR8xEAACsAKIff%22%29+%5D%5D","tags":[],"first_publication_date":"2026-07-27T12:41:59+0000","last_publication_date":"2026-07-27T12:41:59+0000","slugs":["baby-b"],"linked_documents":[],"lang":"fr-fr","alternate_languages":[],"data":{"name":"BABY-B","start_date":"2026-08-28","end_date":null,"display_date":"vendredi 28 août 2026","time":"22H - 03H","cover":{"dimensions":{"width":1276,"height":1699},"alt":null,"copyright":null,"url":"https://images.prismic.io/pointf/ajViso1P9HI4Uv3D_BABYB.jpg?auto=format,compress","id":"ajViso1P9HI4Uv3D","edit":{"x":0,"y":0,"zoom":1,"background":"transparent"}},"text":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Acteur engagé de la scène queer parisienne et fondateur du collectif CLUB YAOI, BABY-B a déjà fait ses preuves sur les scènes de la Too Much ( ex Darude) de la Flash Cocotte en passant par Rinse France.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"En quelques années il joue pour de nombreux collectifs dans les meilleurs clubs de la capitale, des évènements mode pour ADIDAS mais également plus récemment pour La Watch Party de l’influenceur Lyas au Trianon.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Il sort également plusieurs edits qui se font remarquer sur SoundCloud, un premier EP ainsi que des collaborations avec des artistes comme GRAND BLANC ou des collectifs internationaux comme MUAKK.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Son style éclectique et fédérateur traverse les genres, du latin club en passant par le jersey club, la bass ou la dubstep pour raconter des histoires sous bpm tbm.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"}],"video_id":null,"displayed_category":"DJ SET POP - REGGAETON","category":"Clubs","categorie_sec":null,"categorie_ter":null,"prix":"ENTRÉE LIBRE","facebook_link":{"link_type":"Any"},"ticket_link":{"link_type":"Any"},"title_effect":null,"slices":[],"meta_description":null,"meta_image":{},"meta_title":null}},{"id":"anSkihEAACgAbC-5","uid":"take-over-mauvaise-ambiance","url":null,"type":"event","href":"https://pointf.cdn.prismic.io/api/v2/documents/search?ref=ao8RoxIAAC4A-spV&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22anSkihEAACgAbC-5%22%29+%5D%5D","tags":[],"first_publication_date":"2026-08-06T15:34:19+0000","last_publication_date":"2026-08-10T13:30:11+0000","slugs":["take-over-mauvaise-ambiance"],"linked_documents":[],"lang":"fr-fr","alternate_languages":[],"data":{"name":"Take Over Mauvaise Ambiance","start_date":"2026-08-28","end_date":null,"display_date":"vendredi 28 août 2026","time":"22h - 03h","cover":{"dimensions":{"width":400,"height":533},"alt":null,"copyright":null,"url":"https://images.prismic.io/pointf/vVkeOfZRZzti4D0k_28.08-MAUVAISEAMBIANCEcopie.png?auto=format,compress","id":"vVkeOfZRZzti4D0k","edit":{"x":0,"y":0,"zoom":1,"background":"transparent"}},"text":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Mauvaise Ambiance est un collectif de 12 créatif·ves passionné·es de musique et d’art, qui conçoit des expériences festives, inclusives et bienveillantes en réunissant des talents en photo, vidéo, graphisme, musique et écriture.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"}],"video_id":null,"displayed_category":"Take Over bass, latincore, Jungle","category":"Clubs","categorie_sec":null,"categorie_ter":null,"prix":"entrée libre","facebook_link":{"link_type":"Any"},"ticket_link":{"link_type":"Web","key":"8ec14324-892b-43da-833c-6262b465e6af","url":" https://link.dice.fm/W4734b1525d2","target":"_blank"},"title_effect":null,"slices":[],"meta_description":null,"meta_image":{},"meta_title":null}},{"id":"amdSIhEAAC0AKIhS","uid":"roi-luis2908","url":null,"type":"event","href":"https://pointf.cdn.prismic.io/api/v2/documents/search?ref=ao8RoxIAAC4A-spV&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22amdSIhEAAC0AKIhS%22%29+%5D%5D","tags":[],"first_publication_date":"2026-07-27T12:42:36+0000","last_publication_date":"2026-07-27T12:42:36+0000","slugs":["roi-luis"],"linked_documents":[],"lang":"fr-fr","alternate_languages":[],"data":{"name":"Roi Luis","start_date":"2026-08-29","end_date":null,"display_date":"samedi 29 août 2026","time":"22H - 03H","cover":{"dimensions":{"width":850,"height":1276},"alt":null,"copyright":null,"url":"https://images.prismic.io/pointf/ah1PcQeQX7-eWeWW_RoiLuis3%23infininegatifcopie.jpg?auto=format,compress","id":"ah1PcQeQX7-eWeWW","edit":{"x":0,"y":0,"zoom":1,"background":"transparent"}},"text":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"DJ et producteur basé à Paris, son métissage le pousse à explorer sans cesse de nouveaux rythmes pour créer une atmosphère festive, à la croisée des musiques afro-caribéennes, latines et brésiliennes.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Résident sur Rinse France et Flouka, il accompagne des artistes comme Vacra, Myra et Joyce Mena lors de tournées nationales et internationales.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Membre fondateur du duo Sancho & Pancho, il a aussi joué pour Jet Lag, El Perreo, Reggaeton Gang Fusion ou encore la Savage Block Party, ainsi que dans des lieux mythiques de la nuit parisienne (Machine du Moulin Rouge, Cabaret Sauvage…).","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Plongez avec lui dans les musiques qu’il rapporte de ses nombreux voyages dans les Caraïbes et en Amérique du Sud.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"}],"video_id":null,"displayed_category":"DJ SET SALSA, CUMBIA ET REGGAETON","category":"Clubs","categorie_sec":null,"categorie_ter":null,"prix":"ENTRÉE LIBRE","facebook_link":{"link_type":"Any"},"ticket_link":{"link_type":"Any"},"title_effect":null,"slices":[],"meta_description":null,"meta_image":{},"meta_title":null}}],"version":"3f9f504","license":"All Rights Reserved"}